# =========================================================== SETTLEMENT
omni = '''<div class="two"><div class="pnl bad"><p class="cap">Shared omnibus account</p><div class="lane"><span class="lbl">Client A Buy: securities received</span><span class="tok">Held in shared pool</span><span class="lbl">Client B Sell: delivery required</span><span class="tok ghost">Obligation outstanding</span><span class="warn">&#8600; &#8599;</span></div><p class="n">A pooled account can create cross-client settlement and allocation risk.</p></div>
<div class="pnl good"><p class="cap">Dedicated client accounts</p><div class="lane"><span class="lbl">Client A Dedicated Euroclear account</span><span class="tok">A&rsquo;s securities</span></div><div class="lane"><span class="lbl">Client B Dedicated Euroclear account</span><span class="tok b">B&rsquo;s securities</span></div><p class="n">Separate account structures keep each client&rsquo;s securities separately identifiable.</p></div></div>'''
gap = '''<div class="two"><div class="pnl bad"><p class="cap">Without linked trades</p><div class="lk"><div class="rowx"><span>Buy instruction</span><div class="trk"><span class="seg buy" style="left:0;width:30%">Settled</span></div></div><div class="rowx"><span>Sell instruction</span><div class="trk"><span class="seg pend" style="left:30%;width:62%">Failed / pending</span></div></div></div><p class="n">The buy has settled while the onward sell is not ready. The position may need to be financed in the interim.</p></div>
<div class="pnl good"><p class="cap">With linked trades</p><div class="lk"><div class="rowx"><span>Buy instruction</span><div class="trk"><span class="seg hold" style="left:0;width:62%">Held pending</span></div></div><div class="rowx"><span>Sell instruction</span><div class="trk"><span class="seg pend" style="left:0;width:62%">Awaiting settlement</span></div></div></div><p class="n">The linked buy is not released independently while the corresponding sell is unable to settle, subject to the relevant infrastructure and instruction conditions.</p></div></div>'''
vcon = '''<div class="vcon"><div class="doc" aria-label="Illustrative trade confirmation"><span class="scan"></span><h5>BLOOMBERG VCON &middot; ILLUSTRATIVE</h5><span class="hl">Security A</span><span class="hl">Buy</span><span class="hl">100</span><span class="hl">98.250</span><span class="hl">USD</span><span class="hl">Counterparty X</span><div class="ln" style="width:92%"></div><div class="ln" style="width:70%"></div><div class="ln" style="width:84%"></div><div class="ln" style="width:56%"></div></div>
<div><div class="f"><span>Security</span><b>Security A</b><span class="ok">&#10003; Read</span></div><div class="f"><span>Side</span><b>Buy</b><span class="ok">&#10003; Read</span></div><div class="f"><span>Quantity</span><b>100</b><span class="ok">&#10003; Read</span></div><div class="f"><span>Price</span><b>98.250</b><span class="ok">&#10003; Read</span></div><div class="f"><span>Counterparty</span><b>Counterparty X</b><span class="ok">&#10003; Read</span></div></div></div>
<div class="steps4"><div><b>01 / UPLOAD</b>Bloomberg VCON confirmation</div><div><b>02 / EXTRACT</b>Trade fields read from the file</div><div><b>03 / VALIDATE</b>Review and validation</div><div><b>04 / PROCESS</b>Normal trade workflow</div></div>'''
page("settlement-custody.html", "Settlement and Custody: Euroclear Direct Participant | EMFI",
 "Settle for less. Segregated Euroclear accounts, linked buy and sell instructions and Bloomberg VCON upload, from a Euroclear direct participant.", f'''
{hero_full("Settle<br>for <span class='grad'>Less</span>.", "<p class='tri' style='margin-top:26px'>Less Cost. Less Complexity. Less Exposure.</p><p class='lead' style='color:#c3d1e4;margin-top:22px;max-width:52ch'>Settlement and custody for professional clients, built around direct market infrastructure, segregated account structures and connected trade processing.</p>", mark=False)}
{sec("white", f"""{split("", f"Cross Border.<br>Not Cross Settle{G}", "International securities may need to move between different depositories. Securities belonging to different clients should not cross between unrelated settlement obligations.")}<p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:none">In a shared omnibus account, securities received for one client&rsquo;s purchase may be used to meet an unrelated delivery obligation for another client. EMFI can establish dedicated, individually segregated Euroclear accounts for eligible larger clients, where account structure and commercial arrangements justify it. Securities remain separately identifiable within the relevant client account rather than being pooled across unrelated clients.</p>{stagebox(omni)}<div class="split mt" style="align-items:start"><div class="rv"><h3 style="font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,30px);letter-spacing:-.03em">Cross-depository settlement</h3></div><p class="rv" style="color:var(--mute)">For supported securities and markets, EMFI can also arrange settlement across different depositories. For example, a seller settling through DTC may deliver to a buyer receiving through Euroclear, subject to the available settlement route, security eligibility, counterparties and applicable charges.</p></div>
<p class="fine" style="margin-top:14px">{T("Confirm Euroclear participant status, account eligibility and supported cross-depository routes")}</p>""")}
{sec("pale", f"""{split("", f"Mind the<br>(Settlement) Gap{G}", "When your buy settles but your corresponding sell fails to settle, you can be left financing the position and paying interest while you wait.")}<p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:none">EMFI links the two instructions so that the buy is held back if the sell is not ready to settle, helping you avoid the interim financing and associated interest charges. Other settlement-fail charges, such as CSDR penalties and TMPG fails charges, may still apply and are passed through where applicable. Wherever information is available, we automate their capture and provide the relevant references to help you review and dispute charges with your counterparties.</p>{stagebox(gap)}<p class="fine" style="margin-top:14px">Linked settlement can mitigate the financing position described above. It does not prevent all settlement failures or remove CSDR, TMPG or other applicable fail charges. {T("Confirm linked-trade functionality and conditions with Operations")}</p>""")}
{sec("white", f"""{split("", f"Trade Upload, Yes.<br>Manual Entry, No{G}", "A Bloomberg VCON confirmation can carry the trade details already agreed between counterparties. Re-keying those details creates avoidable work and opportunities for input errors.")}<p class="lead rv" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:none">Upload a Bloomberg VCON confirmation and EMFI&rsquo;s system reads the document and extracts the trade details into the trade-entry workflow. You can review and validate the extracted information before processing, without having to re-enter every field manually.</p>{stagebox(vcon)}
<h3 class="rv" style="margin-top:clamp(32px,4vw,56px);font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,36px);letter-spacing:-.03em">More than one way to enter a trade{G}</h3><div class="big3 mt" style="margin-top:22px"><div class="it rv"><h3>Manual entry</h3><p>Enter individual transactions directly into the EMFI interface.</p></div><div class="it rv"><h3>Bulk and file-based</h3><p>Upload supported spreadsheets or submit files through SFTP.</p></div><div class="it rv"><h3>System integration</h3><p>Submit trade information through API or supported drop-copy arrangements.</p></div></div><p class="fine" style="margin-top:18px">Automated extraction is subject to supported VCON formats, information quality and validation controls. Review remains part of the trade-entry process.</p>""")}
{QUIZ}
{sec("pale", f"""<h2 style="margin-bottom:clamp(28px,4vw,50px)">Regulatory information{G}</h2><div class="split" style="align-items:start"><div class="cards" style="grid-template-columns:1fr">{entity("United Kingdom", "EMFI Capital Limited", [("Company No.", "11380609"), ("FCA FRN", "822389")], "<p>Authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority.</p><p>" + LON + ".</p>")}{entity("Dubai International Financial Centre", "EMFI Capital (DIFC) Limited", [("DFSA Reference No.", "F011663")], "<p>Authorised and regulated by the Dubai Financial Services Authority. Services and client asset arrangements are subject to the DIFC regulatory framework and the entity&rsquo;s permissions.</p><p>Park Towers, DIFC, Dubai, United Arab Emirates. " + T("Office suite and level to be confirmed against current approved records") + "</p>")}</div><div>{mapbox("25-26 Dering Street, London W1S 1AW", "Map: EMFI Capital Limited, London")}</div></div>
<p class="fine" style="margin-top:22px">Settlement and custody arrangements depend on legal entity, client classification, asset eligibility, account structure, depository access, counterparties and contractual terms. Segregation and linked settlement mitigate specific risks; they do not eliminate all custody, settlement, financing, depository or counterparty risks. {T("Detailed client asset disclosures to be reviewed before publication")}</p>""", "entities")}''', "settlement-custody.html")

